  "bookId": "EPH",
  "reference": "Abaefeso 5",
  "verseCount": 28,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "5",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EPH 5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "5",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Murondore Ruhanga orwo muli bana abagonzibwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oburora bwanyu bube bw'engonzi, nk'okwo Kirisito yatugondize akatwetambilira, akaba kihongo mara kitambo ky'omugaju eky'okushemelera Ruhanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nk'okwo abakirisito baragiirwe, obusiyani n'obuhagare obwa buli ngeli anga obujanga omuli inywe bitakuhulirwamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutakugamba bya busheegu, mutakujoborwa anga kugamba ebitakomire mu kibunu, ebitalikusana. Ekiliho mugire esiimi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kimanyikege okwo omusiyani anga enjanga, anga olinya afukamira ebihuku taina kutaha mu bukama bwa Kirisito anga bwa Ruhanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuntu atababeiyesa bigambo ebitaina mbali bili, enshonga ebi nibyo bisindika Ruhanga kunigalira abantu abatagira muhuliro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kityo mutamanyirangana nabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwaturaga omu mwilima, kyonkai kwema mubaire bantu b'Omukama mbwenu muli omu mushana. Kityo murore nk'abantu ab'omushana, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nobona omushana nigwo gurugwamu kaishe kantu akarungi, akagorogokire mara ak'amazima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutemu amani mumanye ebishemelera Omukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebikorwa by'omwilima ebitarugwamu birungi mutabikora; hakili mubihere orubona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kigambo ky'enshoni kufumora ebigambo eby'abantu bakora bwesheleke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekintu kyona kyona kakishururwa omushana kiboneka, kuba ekibonekage kyona kyona guba mushana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikyo bagambira bati,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muhulirangane aha rw'okukunira Kirisito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inywe bakazi muhulire bashaija banyu, nk'okwo mulikuhulira Omukama wenene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omushaija n'iwe aba mutwe gw'omukazi, nk'okwo Kirisito aba mutwe gw'enteko, nigwo mubiligwe, mara n'iwe murokozi w'enteko egyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nk'okwo enteko ehulira Kirisito, n'abakazi kwakwo bahulire baibabo omuli byona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inywe bashaija mugonze bakazi banyu nk'okwo Kirisito yagondize enteko akagifelekelera, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abone kugyeza orwo yagyelize n'ekigambokye n'amaizi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ashobore kukwasa enteko enshemere, etaina kibara anga mikanya, handiki kyona kyona nk'eki, enteko egyo eshobore kuba ntakatifu obuzira kamogo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abashaija nibaragirwa kugonza abakazi babo nk'okwo bonene balikugonza emibili yabo. Ayakagonza mukaziwe ayegonza wenene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuba taliho muntu n'omoi anoba mubiligwe, shana aguliisa n'okuguhyahyanira, nka Kirisito okwo aliisa enteko akagihyahyanira, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuba tuli ngingo z'omubiligwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwo bili biti, omuntu arasigagaho ishe na nyina ajwangane na mukaziwe, bombili babe mubili gumoi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekyebisho eki ky'amani, mara nikimanyisa Kirisito n'enteko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 5:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahonu buli omoi agonze mukaziwe nk'okwo wenene alikwegonza, kandi n'omukazi ateho aga wenene kukunira mushaijawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.5.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.5.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
